WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.568
-Tonight is the final night
of BTS Week.

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:03.569
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:06.039
I'm gonna miss those...

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:09.576
I really want to take a moment
to just thank the band,

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.944
not only for the interviews
and the games,

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:15.014
but every single night,
there's been an incredible,

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.816
spectacular,
beautifully directed,

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:19.552
choreographed,
produced performance,

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:24.790
and they're ranking up like
millions of views on YouTube.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.760
They are talented,
talented humans,

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.094
and that leads me
to my next shout-out --

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:31.597
their fans, the BTS Army.

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:34.734
They are some of the most
loyal, positive, and fun fans

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.135
that you could ever dream of.

00:00:36.135 --> 00:00:38.671
And I just want to say thank you
to all of them.

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.639
"Chimmy" Fallon loves you.

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:44.377
[ Applause ]
Yeah.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.079
And as a treat for you guys, BTS
is closing out the show tonight

00:00:47.079 --> 00:00:49.482
with another
exclusive performance.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:50.817
And I know
you're gonna love it.

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:51.818
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:53.552
They are amazing.
-Yeah.

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.354
-I don't know how
they just keep doing it.

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:57.390
They're perfectionists.
They just crush it.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.159
Oh, I also want to mention
BTS is performing a special

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:04.230
livestream concert,
BTS Map of the Soul: 1.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.299
It streams worldwide
on October 10th and 11th.

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:09.468
It has all kinds
of incredible technology --

00:01:09.468 --> 00:01:13.472
AR, XR, multi-view screens,
and a few more surprises.

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:15.374
Be sure to check it out.
It's gonna be great.

00:01:15.374 --> 00:01:16.909
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.411
Really, thank you, BTS.

